			"notes": "# PathSeeker v1.0.7 – Release Notes\n\n## What’s New\n- **AutoPortal**: Automatically make nether portals [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n- **TridentAura**: Spam Tridents. [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n- **CollectorsESP**: Highlights maparts and banners. [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n- **BaritonePathMacro**: Easy macro to activate TrailFollower in the nether. Must deploy in the air. [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n\n\n## Enhancements & Fixes\n### Bug Fixes\n- **AutoPortal:** Fixed issue when it would try to make a portal in the same place as an already placed portal.\n\n### Improvements\n- **New Nether-PathFinding for TrailFollower**: [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n- **Vanilla-Mode: for trail follower** [xqyet](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/commits?author=xqyet)\n\n## Known Issues\n- Minor rendering glitches during dimension transitions.\n- Rare server-side compatibility issues with some chunk detection methods.\n\n## Additional Resources\n- **Full Changelog:** [View on GitHub](https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/compare/1.0.6...main)"
		},
