			"notes": "# Release Notes - **PathSeeker v1.0.2**\n\n## What's New\n- **MobGearESP**  Detects mobs carrying or wearing player equipment.\n\n## Current Features\n### Utility\n- **ActivatedSpawnerDetector**: Detects activated spawners in your vicinity for exploration and base tracking.\n\n### Exploration\n- **Base Finder**: Locate hidden bases using detection algorithms tailored for anarchy servers.\n- **NewChunks**: Identify newly generated chunks to find untouched terrain.\n- **PortalPatternFinder** *(New)*: Locate broken/removed Nether Portals for potential portal skips.\n- **CaveDisturbanceDetector** *(New)*: Detect minor cave disruptions, like single air blocks, for exploration.\n\n### Renders\n- **Hole, Tunnel, and Stair ESP**: Highlights holes, tunnels, and stairs for easier navigation.\n- **PotESP**: Tracks Decorated Pots with unnatural contents.\n- **MobGearESP**  Detects mobs carrying or wearing player equipment.\n\n\n### Automation\n- **StorageLooter**: Automatically loots containers and organizes items efficiently.\n\n## Known Issues\n- Minor rendering glitches may occur during dimension transitions.\n- Certain chunk detection methods may face rare server-side compatibility issues.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/FaxHack/PathSeeker/compare/1.0.1...1.0.2"
		}
